{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">[收录于&nbsp; <strong><em><a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"/news/2396/content00795?type=0\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">#链产品&nbsp;</span></a></em></strong> 合集]</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; color: #ffffff; background-color: #169179;\">&nbsp;引言&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px; color: #000000;\">随着仓储科技的日新月异，仓储运营与管理也由单一订单执行转变到智能化决策。这也不断推动着仓储管理系统从传统WMS朝着协同自动化集成管控的WES（仓储执行系统，以下简称WES）发展。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px; color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #c91623;\"><strong><a style=\"color: #c91623;\" href=\"/WES\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">京东物流WES</a></strong></span>是京东物流打造的智能仓储执行系统。聚焦消费品、3C、能源三大主流行业，重点支持千平米以上，机器区为主、兼顾人区的自动化仓库场景。WES通过集成丰富的业务流程 ，沉淀并输出京东亚一自动化管理经验，面向仓库运营及管理者，提供兼容主流自动化设备的业务功能，帮助企业解决仓储难题，从而实现科学高效的管理。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">企业痛点：仓库任务复杂多样，无法快速实现最优调度。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/WES\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #169179; font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">京东物流WES</span></strong></span></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #169179; font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">智能协同中枢 &mdash; 任务中心</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #169179;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">01</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; color: #000000;\">任务中心站在全局的角度解决多种任务之间的调度，灵活配置组装，保证仓内各作业任务有条不紊；</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; color: #000000;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/114364/20/28879/222475/6321b394Ed62c4ee0/75633179562467fb.png\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #169179;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">02</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; color: #000000;\">覆盖仓储作业主流环节的智能任务协同，包含收货、上架、拣货、分播、复核、盘点、理货等；</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/101083/11/31644/45430/6321b3a3Ea855d6bb/bd25f4573e29a66d.png\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #169179;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">03</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; color: #000000;\">通过算法智能调度各类任务，智能进行组波，定位排产和拣货路径优化等，使仓库运行实现全仓最优和效率最大化。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/121571/36/30423/45064/6321b3adEbcdd4d04/71cfd339a3be0d87.png\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">企业痛点：个性化场景多，系统扩展性差，二次开发成本高。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/WES\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #169179; font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">京东物流WES</span></strong></span></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #169179; font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">适配多种自动化场景+二开源码开放</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #169179;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">01</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; color: #000000;\">WES轻享版可涵盖消费品、3C、能源行业等常见场景和行业共性所需功能，支持人区入库、在库、出库、RF端等场景，聚焦机器区典型场景，兼容立库、天狼、地狼、机械臂等多种主流自动化设备，支持ToB、ToC、BC同仓；</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/204087/7/26721/24884/6321b416Ea9d89177/c74e7c0d8d7232f2.png\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #169179;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">02</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; color: #000000;\">支持二开源码开放，灵活高效，大幅降低定制化二次开发成本，同时提供多种主流场景的二开解决方案，如：业务流程和策略规则的增加、删减、修改，报表的新增，API（应用程序编程端口）开放，页面扩展等；</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/36535/6/18399/29370/6321b424Eb434cce6/693e9edc1c9e05ea.png\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #169179;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">03</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; color: #000000;\">模块化设计，可根据现场运营需求情况，通过流程配置开关选择所需的功能模块或调整流程的顺序，真正实现积木化拆装。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/176268/6/28095/21105/6321b443Ef6412497/7a607a318a9d3e15.png\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">企业痛点：对接系统繁杂，接口联调耗时长且效率低。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/WES\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #169179; font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">京东物流WES</span></strong></span></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #169179; font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">更加便捷智能的数据交换平台</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; color: #000000;\">WES集成京东物流的数据交换平台，沉淀共性接口，将对接过的业务共性部分进行组件化，可大幅降低接口联调工时，同时还可链接各种主流上游系统,保证数据交换的高效性与便捷性。此外，WES还支持对接京东物流自研多种上下游系统与多种三方 WCS（仓储控制系统）、RCS（机器人控制系统）。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/197442/36/25237/26165/6321b472Ee85dad2c/c74d6ff07da871f4.png\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">企业痛点：仓库多设备多系统并行，人机交互体验差，培训成本高。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/WES\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #169179; font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">京东物流WES</span></strong></span></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #169179; font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">界面简单易用，可视化强</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #169179;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">01</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; color: #000000;\">界面操作简单易用，灵活适配现场多种主流自动化设备场景，提供人性化和多元化的人机交互设计，大幅降低操作人员培训学习成本。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/188087/29/27725/39571/6321b4b3E223b6844/92881b50ac8259d2.png\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #169179;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">02</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; color: #000000;\">采用业界先进的设计理念，统一界面UI框架，界面可扩展性强，支持灵活定制可视化看板及智慧大屏。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/31946/24/17476/99907/6321b4c0Efe752240/d57a1236ef027418.png\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; color: #000000;\"><a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"/WES\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">京东物流WES</a>适配由简单到复杂的主流自动化业务场景，通过丰富易用的模块化功能、智能协同的任务中心、灵活的二开和数据交换平台，为企业提供智能化解决方案，帮助企业实现仓储的高效运行和降本增效，全面助力企业的数字化转型和智能化升级。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://getwuce.jdl.com/#/diyForm?formCode=BD3187402377390195328&amp;channelL1Code=l1-ch8&amp;channelCode=wucech87219\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/156885/15/30390/43354/6322ee8aEee602e7c/921b1e5af849180e.png\" /></a></p>", "contentAbstract": "", "contentCode": "content00819", "contentTitle": "智能仓解决方案WES：更懂自动化仓库的仓储执行系统", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1663152928000, "id": 2424, "isDelete": 0, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "projectName": "京东物流官网", "srcUrl": "/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/175900/16/27330/24884/6321b4d2E20a256dd/2d33a82c802968d5.png", "updateTime": 1677564950000}}